  <content>
    <faultIsolation>
      <faultIsolationProcedure>
        <fault faultCode="NAYACAR-DA6-002"/>
        <faultDescr><descr>Şarj lambası yanıyor, farlar sönük ya da dalgalı, akü sık sık boşalıyor ya da ampuller sık yanıyor.</descr></faultDescr>
        <isolationProcedure>
          <preliminaryRqmts><reqCondGroup><noConds/></reqCondGroup><reqSupportEquips><noSupportEquips/></reqSupportEquips><reqSupplies><noSupplies/></reqSupplies><reqSpares><noSpares/></reqSpares><reqSafety><noSafety/></reqSafety></preliminaryRqmts>
          <isolationMainProcedure>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0001">
              <action>Aksesuar kayışını kontrol edin.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Kayış gevşek, çatlak ya da ötüyor mu?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="end-belt"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="stp-0002"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0002">
              <action>Motor 2000 d/d'de çalışırken akü gerilimini ölçün.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Gerilim 13,9 V'un altında mı?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="stp-0003"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="stp-0004"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0003">
              <action>Alternatörün B ucuyla akü artı kutbu arasındaki gerilim düşümünü ölçün.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Fark 0,5 V'tan büyük mü?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="end-cable"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="end-alternator"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0004">
              <action>Ölçmeye devam edin.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Gerilim 15,1 V'un üstünde mi?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="end-regulator"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="end-battery"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-belt"><action>Kayışı gerin ya da değiştirin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYACAR" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA1" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="01" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="920" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-cable"><action>Şarj kablosu ya da sigortası (ALT 100 A) arızalı; bağlantıları temizleyin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYACAR" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA6" subSystemCode="6" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="250" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-alternator"><action>Alternatör şarj etmiyor; alternatörü test edip değiştirin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYACAR" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA6" subSystemCode="3" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="320" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-regulator"><action>Regülatör aşırı şarj ediyor; alternatörü değiştirin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYACAR" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA6" subSystemCode="3" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="920" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-battery"><action>Şarj normal: aküyü test edin; araç dururken akım çeken bir devre olabilir (en çok 20 mA). <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYACAR" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA6" subSystemCode="1" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="300" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
          </isolationMainProcedure>
          <closeRqmts><reqCondGroup><noConds/></reqCondGroup></closeRqmts>
        </isolationProcedure>
      </faultIsolationProcedure>
    </faultIsolation>
